WEBVTT

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:06.650
<b>GUNDAM
VICTORY
MOBILE SUIT</b>

00:01:21.160 --> 00:01:24.030
LAUNCH THE MOTORAD

00:01:24.030 --> 00:01:26.700
"Launch the Motorad".

00:01:50.800 --> 00:01:53.930
That's it! Right! Hold it firmly!

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:55.900
Now, pick it up, just like that.

00:01:56.900 --> 00:01:58.460
Right, raise it like that!

00:01:58.500 --> 00:01:59.960
You're doing great, Odelo!

00:02:00.130 --> 00:02:02.930
Easy-peasy! See?

00:02:03.630 --> 00:02:05.160
Don't rush.

00:02:07.030 --> 00:02:09.130
See? They can do it if they try.

00:02:09.160 --> 00:02:12.960
But isn't sending the White Ark off so suddenly a little unreasonable?

00:02:13.300 --> 00:02:16.060
They'll just be doing basic work. They'll be fine.

00:02:16.400 --> 00:02:19.600
Karel, they told us to follow Tomáš and Odelo.

00:02:19.960 --> 00:02:21.360
Coming to the White Ark?

00:02:21.400 --> 00:02:22.900
I'll wait here for Üso.

00:02:22.930 --> 00:02:23.800
Me, too!

00:02:25.300 --> 00:02:26.900
Okay, I'll take this.

00:02:26.930 --> 00:02:29.130
Just be careful you're not spotted!

00:02:36.900 --> 00:02:38.460
And, there they go.

00:02:38.500 --> 00:02:39.730
I'm bored.

00:02:39.760 --> 00:02:41.500
Huh? Why?

00:02:41.860 --> 00:02:44.860
We finally make it to the League Militaire's lunar factory,

00:02:44.900 --> 00:02:47.130
and there's nothing we can do to help.

00:02:47.160 --> 00:02:48.400
No, there's plenty.

00:02:48.430 --> 00:02:52.430
Helping with the cooking, the washing, cleaning the baths, going food shopping...

00:02:52.460 --> 00:02:55.400
It's not just "women's work".

00:02:55.460 --> 00:02:59.000
It's important day-to-day stuff people need to do to live.

00:02:59.530 --> 00:03:01.160
Suzy, you're really mature.

00:03:01.730 --> 00:03:05.160
What are you talking about? You taught me that, Shahkti!

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:06.560
Get a grip!

00:03:06.600 --> 00:03:07.500
I did?

00:03:07.530 --> 00:03:11.030
Huh? The Reineforce Junior's group left already?!

00:03:11.060 --> 00:03:13.000
We're still here. What's up?

00:03:13.030 --> 00:03:15.700
We just received intel that...

00:03:15.730 --> 00:03:19.060
...BESPA's Motorad space fleet is about to launch for Earth!

00:03:19.800 --> 00:03:21.430
Juca, we're heading out!

00:03:21.460 --> 00:03:22.230
Roger!

00:03:22.430 --> 00:03:24.530
BESPA's fleet is on the moon?

00:03:24.560 --> 00:03:26.400
That's what the rumors say.

00:03:26.430 --> 00:03:28.530
Is something bad about to happen again?

00:03:28.900 --> 00:03:30.860
BESPA's fleet is on the moon?

00:03:32.160 --> 00:03:33.900
Suzy, watch Karl for me.

00:03:33.930 --> 00:03:35.700
Okay, but what's wrong?

00:03:35.800 --> 00:03:37.230
I have something important to do!

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:39.200
There, there...

00:03:49.430 --> 00:03:53.160
That suspicious tunnel Üso's mother was going to investigate...

00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:55.360
...might be where the fleet is.

00:03:58.660 --> 00:04:01.260
Shahkti, Üso is on the road to the right.

00:04:01.360 --> 00:04:02.060
It's okay.

00:04:02.100 --> 00:04:03.430
Where are you going?

00:04:03.460 --> 00:04:07.860
If there's a secret tunnel in the neutral city of Saint Josef,

00:04:07.900 --> 00:04:10.400
then there must be Zanscare military officers.

00:04:10.430 --> 00:04:13.700
As the queen's daughter and Cronicle's relative,

00:04:13.730 --> 00:04:15.830
I should at least be able to ask them a favor.

00:04:24.800 --> 00:04:27.830
So, exposing the rebel elements in this city is proving difficult?

00:04:27.860 --> 00:04:30.630
What do you think about the part with the kids?

00:04:31.130 --> 00:04:34.300
If it was a boy who saved a woman who appeared to be a spy,

00:04:34.330 --> 00:04:36.900
it was probably Üso Ewin and his gang.

00:04:36.930 --> 00:04:40.160
From the description and clothes, it had to have been him.

00:04:40.730 --> 00:04:44.500
The Motorad Fleet must leave in sequence for Earth.

00:04:44.960 --> 00:04:49.560
Keep searching, and capture him. But avoid any rough treatment.

00:04:49.630 --> 00:04:50.330
Sir!

00:04:53.600 --> 00:04:55.460
There's gravity on the moon, too!

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:03.460
Maybe not as good as Üso, but you're adapting quickly.

00:05:03.830 --> 00:05:06.330
Kids who grow up in tough times really are different.

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:09.630
Easy! If I put my mind to something, I do it!

00:05:14.630 --> 00:05:16.060
Whoa, whoa, whoa!

00:05:32.030 --> 00:05:33.700
How many more suits are we transporting?

00:05:33.730 --> 00:05:37.460
I'll have Juca and Cony fly straight to the Reineforce Junior.

00:05:37.700 --> 00:05:39.930
This ship can only carry four.

00:05:40.330 --> 00:05:43.460
Have Odelo and Tomáš fly there. It'll be good training.

00:05:43.600 --> 00:05:44.830
You plan to use them?

00:05:44.860 --> 00:05:47.960
Yeah, I think those two will make a good team.

00:05:48.130 --> 00:05:50.330
Bad habits are hard to break, I see.

00:05:50.430 --> 00:05:51.660
Is that a problem?

00:05:51.700 --> 00:05:55.260
He says he wants to be a pilot, so all I can do is let him do it.

00:05:55.300 --> 00:05:56.760
Cony's unit is coming aboard!

00:05:56.800 --> 00:05:57.600
Okay!

00:05:58.600 --> 00:06:01.600
Commander Oliver, the enemy space fleet is moving out.

00:06:02.300 --> 00:06:04.260
The infamous Motorad space fleet?

00:06:04.360 --> 00:06:05.030
Yes!

00:06:05.060 --> 00:06:06.630
Cancel the supply run.

00:06:06.660 --> 00:06:10.000
If we pick up the enemy ships taking off, we'll intercept them with full force!

00:06:10.030 --> 00:06:10.800
Right.

00:06:11.300 --> 00:06:14.560
Odelo, Tomáš, get to the Reineforce Junior and inform them.

00:06:14.600 --> 00:06:16.030
We can't risk using the radio.

00:06:16.060 --> 00:06:16.900
Roger!

00:06:18.730 --> 00:06:21.330
Karel's arrived. I'll bring him in.

00:06:21.460 --> 00:06:23.430
We'll head out to reconnoiter.

00:06:31.260 --> 00:06:33.130
Another fleet battle?!

00:06:34.230 --> 00:06:38.230
Seeing as it's called the Motorad Fleet, it must be those tire-equipped battleships.

00:06:38.530 --> 00:06:40.930
What about the repairs to the Reineforce Junior?

00:06:41.030 --> 00:06:44.330
They're doing it with parts we brought in overnight.

00:06:44.730 --> 00:06:49.400
Warren, you'll be manning this vessel's air defense.

00:06:49.600 --> 00:06:50.930
A-Aye, sir!

00:06:50.960 --> 00:06:53.560
I'll go inspect the missile pods below decks!

00:06:57.330 --> 00:06:59.460
D-Do I have a fever?

00:07:00.830 --> 00:07:01.900
She's not here?

00:07:02.060 --> 00:07:04.200
I thought she went to you, Üso.

00:07:04.730 --> 00:07:06.430
She says Shahkti isn't here.

00:07:06.600 --> 00:07:09.400
She left right after hearing about the Motorad space fleet?

00:07:09.430 --> 00:07:10.800
That what she says.

00:07:11.000 --> 00:07:13.500
There's nowhere else she could have gone...

00:07:13.660 --> 00:07:14.630
You don't suppose...

00:07:14.660 --> 00:07:16.360
Do you have any ideas?

00:07:16.460 --> 00:07:19.700
Yeah. Didn't you mention a tunnel last night...

00:07:19.730 --> 00:07:21.960
...that leads to Neo Cartagena?

00:07:22.400 --> 00:07:26.830
You mean the place where I was nearly caught by BESPA's secret police?

00:07:26.860 --> 00:07:28.000
That's it!

00:07:28.300 --> 00:07:31.360
Shahkti thinks BESPA warships are in Neo Cartagena,

00:07:31.400 --> 00:07:33.660
and so she went there!

00:07:33.700 --> 00:07:35.860
Why would a quiet girl like her...?

00:07:36.100 --> 00:07:38.400
Because Shahkti's... Never mind, I'm going after her!

00:07:38.430 --> 00:07:40.400
Üso, what's going on?!

00:07:41.160 --> 00:07:43.130
Mrs. Myra, what's wrong?

00:07:44.260 --> 00:07:45.460
Mrs. Myra!

00:07:45.930 --> 00:07:50.100
Foreman, the Core Fighter in this unit is ready to fly, right?

00:07:50.130 --> 00:07:51.130
Of course.

00:07:52.500 --> 00:07:54.260
Get to the White Ark.

00:07:54.700 --> 00:07:56.530
But I said I'd wait.

00:07:56.960 --> 00:07:58.900
She's not coming back here!

00:08:02.600 --> 00:08:06.760
That's the entrance to the construction site she mentioned.

00:08:07.100 --> 00:08:08.760
Looks pretty secure.

00:08:09.100 --> 00:08:10.500
How do I get in?

00:08:16.060 --> 00:08:18.730
This won't work if they think I'm not with BESPA.

00:08:18.760 --> 00:08:21.460
Shahkti! Let's leave! Let's leave!

00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:29.100
That man, Cronicle Asher, is related to Shahkti?

00:08:29.630 --> 00:08:32.660
And he's the Zanscare queen's younger brother.

00:08:36.400 --> 00:08:37.030
Who...

00:08:40.330 --> 00:08:42.130
Quit fussing!

00:08:44.300 --> 00:08:46.600
They're carrying the V2's Core Fighter.

00:08:51.060 --> 00:08:54.800
You want to go in that gate? That's not an amusement park!

00:08:54.830 --> 00:08:55.900
B-But...

00:08:56.000 --> 00:08:58.600
I don't know anything about BESPA or Zanscare.

00:08:59.400 --> 00:09:01.460
Flanders, Haro, let's go.

00:09:01.500 --> 00:09:02.230
Haro!

00:09:05.560 --> 00:09:06.530
Pardon me.

00:09:06.560 --> 00:09:09.400
Flanders, stop that! What do you want?

00:09:09.700 --> 00:09:11.700
Miss Shahkti Kareen, right?

00:09:11.730 --> 00:09:13.330
What? Yes.

00:09:13.500 --> 00:09:15.200
We've come for you.

00:09:15.460 --> 00:09:17.730
May I see Lieutenant Cronicle Asher?

00:09:17.960 --> 00:09:19.500
Um, well...

00:09:19.600 --> 00:09:22.660
We'll explain the situation in the car.

00:09:22.930 --> 00:09:23.700
Haro!

00:09:26.960 --> 00:09:28.130
Haro! Flanders!

00:09:28.160 --> 00:09:30.000
You have to get inside now!

00:09:49.230 --> 00:09:51.200
It's Flanders! Haro, too!

00:09:51.600 --> 00:09:54.400
Üso, your mom was right!

00:09:56.630 --> 00:09:59.530
Hang on tight! We're busting through!

00:10:00.130 --> 00:10:01.630
What's with that trailer?!

00:10:01.900 --> 00:10:03.300
They smashed the gate!

00:10:04.030 --> 00:10:06.330
Send out security mobile suits! Hurry!

00:10:10.830 --> 00:10:14.160
Üso, we've got mobile suit movement. Hurry!

00:10:17.760 --> 00:10:19.030
Mom, I'm moving out.

00:10:19.160 --> 00:10:20.400
Whenever you're ready.

00:10:29.930 --> 00:10:31.930
Can you get through such a narrow passage?

00:10:31.960 --> 00:10:34.160
I can do this, Mom.

00:10:35.560 --> 00:10:37.930
An airlock! They're headed outside?!

00:10:40.860 --> 00:10:41.830
What?!

00:10:49.060 --> 00:10:50.030
That's...

00:11:01.930 --> 00:11:04.260
I thought it was fixed, but...

00:11:05.630 --> 00:11:07.430
Who's in those two suits?

00:11:11.930 --> 00:11:14.160
Oh, you two were piloting them?

00:11:14.430 --> 00:11:16.260
The BESPA Motorad space fleet!

00:11:16.300 --> 00:11:17.530
It looks like it's moving!

00:11:17.560 --> 00:11:19.630
The fleet's setting sail?

00:11:19.960 --> 00:11:24.160
The White Ark's headed to Neo Cartagena to stop them!

00:11:24.260 --> 00:11:27.060
Neo Cartagena's in a huge gorge.

00:11:27.100 --> 00:11:30.360
Making it a good hiding place. I'll inform the bridge!

00:11:30.400 --> 00:11:31.260
Right!

00:11:33.260 --> 00:11:35.600
Üso, never mind about me!

00:11:36.030 --> 00:11:39.660
I asked them to take me! If Cronicle's in this fleet,

00:11:39.700 --> 00:11:42.960
then I'll ask him to stop the fleet's launch!

00:11:43.400 --> 00:11:46.060
He'll never agree to that!

00:11:46.500 --> 00:11:49.100
Üso, that light! It's the space fleet!

00:11:49.130 --> 00:11:49.930
Huh?

00:11:52.230 --> 00:11:54.100
They're already taking off!

00:11:54.130 --> 00:11:55.030
We need to tell someone!

00:11:55.060 --> 00:11:56.300
Üso, please understand!

00:11:56.600 --> 00:11:59.230
We can't let that fleet go to Earth!

00:11:59.330 --> 00:12:01.200
I want to stop them!

00:12:01.230 --> 00:12:04.200
How do I do this without hurting Shahkti?

00:12:05.500 --> 00:12:08.030
Right, we're bringing the princess!

00:12:08.060 --> 00:12:09.360
Pick us up!

00:12:09.400 --> 00:12:10.700
Go inside, please.

00:12:10.730 --> 00:12:12.530
Üso, just let me go!

00:12:12.560 --> 00:12:13.730
No!

00:12:13.930 --> 00:12:17.060
Shahkti, the military doesn't work as simply as you think it does!

00:12:18.960 --> 00:12:20.660
Stop! Just stop!

00:12:20.900 --> 00:12:23.700
Üso, let me jump onto that vehicle.

00:12:23.860 --> 00:12:24.630
Mom!

00:12:24.760 --> 00:12:25.530
Hurry!

00:12:44.530 --> 00:12:47.760
Was this report that we have Shahkti Kareen false?

00:12:47.800 --> 00:12:48.900
N-No, sir.

00:12:48.930 --> 00:12:50.060
Lieutenant Cronicle.

00:12:50.260 --> 00:12:50.960
What?

00:12:51.130 --> 00:12:54.860
Possible Core Fighter has been sighted to the south of the runway.

00:12:54.900 --> 00:12:57.400
The League Militaire have entered the area?

00:12:57.430 --> 00:12:58.360
Dispose of it!

00:12:59.030 --> 00:13:01.530
Most of the pilots are aboard this ship.

00:13:01.700 --> 00:13:03.260
You're saying they aren't moving?

00:13:03.300 --> 00:13:06.260
No, sir. Schwartzrad Team has already taken off.

00:13:06.600 --> 00:13:07.830
We'll move out, as well!

00:13:07.860 --> 00:13:08.700
Sir!

00:13:22.560 --> 00:13:25.730
It's one Core Fighter! I'll finish it by myself!

00:13:26.400 --> 00:13:30.160
You get to say that when you've earned trust and become a commander!

00:13:30.430 --> 00:13:33.630
Except, it looks like there's more than one enemy here. He's all yours!

00:13:39.960 --> 00:13:43.630
Marbet, Cony, you handle the tires! I'll go after the battleships!

00:13:43.700 --> 00:13:44.460
Roger! Roger!

00:13:53.730 --> 00:13:57.030
We'll never get past them while they're fighting the Einerads!

00:13:58.300 --> 00:13:59.330
Who are you?

00:13:59.360 --> 00:14:00.400
Let go of the princess!

00:14:00.430 --> 00:14:03.400
If this girl dies, you'll suffer for it too, right?

00:14:10.130 --> 00:14:12.660
Turn us around! We're taking the princess back!

00:14:17.400 --> 00:14:19.130
Don't drive around here!

00:14:20.130 --> 00:14:21.130
Those two!

00:14:27.660 --> 00:14:29.830
Dammit, now I can't fire!

00:14:32.030 --> 00:14:35.430
If the secret police captured a "princess," it must be Shahkti!

00:14:38.130 --> 00:14:41.160
Stop! Stop it, please! It's you, isn't it, Miss Katejina?

00:14:41.200 --> 00:14:42.600
Fight Üso!

00:14:43.130 --> 00:14:44.330
Why, you!

00:14:46.300 --> 00:14:47.660
Y-You!

00:14:48.700 --> 00:14:53.060
If this woman was with Shahkti, we can still use her as a hostage!

00:14:54.060 --> 00:14:54.960
Shahkti!

00:14:55.000 --> 00:14:55.900
Üso!

00:14:58.800 --> 00:15:02.130
You're not getting away! I'll use you all as hostages!

00:15:05.600 --> 00:15:08.060
There should be a seatbelt in back. Over there!

00:15:38.200 --> 00:15:40.660
Do we just let them take off?!

00:15:41.960 --> 00:15:43.260
That's the flagship!

00:15:43.360 --> 00:15:47.630
If we destroy their most powerful ship here, we can go after the rest later!

00:15:50.630 --> 00:15:52.860
Odelo and Tomáš are going out, too?!

00:15:52.900 --> 00:15:54.160
Let them go.

00:15:54.260 --> 00:15:56.260
We'll teach them how to act as the rear guard!

00:15:56.300 --> 00:15:57.360
It's on your own head!

00:15:57.430 --> 00:15:59.100
You need all the help you can get!

00:15:59.130 --> 00:16:00.760
And we won't overdo it!

00:16:04.460 --> 00:16:06.200
It's practically in my face!

00:16:08.900 --> 00:16:11.360
Where'd the Shrike team go?!

00:16:14.960 --> 00:16:17.500
Like I'd let even one of you pass!

00:16:20.900 --> 00:16:23.100
Where are you taking my mother?!

00:16:23.260 --> 00:16:26.660
This stubbornness can only be Üso's! Enough, already!

00:16:34.960 --> 00:16:36.500
She's escaping into that ship!

00:16:36.530 --> 00:16:37.060
Üso!

00:16:37.100 --> 00:16:38.030
Yes, sir!

00:16:38.830 --> 00:16:42.660
That's their flagship! Stop that, and the fleet falls apart!

00:16:52.160 --> 00:16:56.400
To stop it from taking off, we'll have to target the tires, Mr. Oliver!

00:17:00.800 --> 00:17:02.800
The Core Fighter doesn't have the firepower!

00:17:02.830 --> 00:17:05.030
Üso, if you're the man for the job, then do it!

00:17:05.360 --> 00:17:06.530
Use this!

00:17:07.630 --> 00:17:08.900
Understood!

00:17:17.930 --> 00:17:19.960
Why isn't it working?!

00:17:22.830 --> 00:17:25.800
Üso, you guerrillas trapped in your individualism...

00:17:25.830 --> 00:17:28.230
...are no longer any match for us!

00:17:31.460 --> 00:17:34.660
Miss Katejina, if that's you, give me back my mother!

00:17:37.930 --> 00:17:39.960
It's because of that new model of his!

00:17:42.800 --> 00:17:46.160
I told you, I'm not letting you go to Earth!

00:17:50.030 --> 00:17:52.300
Evasive! If he rams us...

00:17:52.330 --> 00:17:56.400
...and his engine blows, it'll damage our ship, too!

00:17:59.830 --> 00:18:01.660
I said I'm not letting you go!

00:18:02.160 --> 00:18:05.430
Marbet, take care of our child!

00:18:20.700 --> 00:18:24.560
He did it! Jettison the damaged wheel!

00:18:28.400 --> 00:18:31.430
What happened? My heart's pounding!

00:18:34.460 --> 00:18:38.160
You want to kill yourself? Then I'll shoot, as you wish!

00:18:44.930 --> 00:18:47.260
Miss Marbet, get your head in the game!

00:18:47.300 --> 00:18:48.800
Were you damaged?!

00:18:49.730 --> 00:18:52.300
I... Oliver!

00:18:52.330 --> 00:18:56.160
I'm scared! I can't stop shaking.

00:18:58.630 --> 00:19:02.760
If not for their interference, I'd have destroyed a Gundam!

00:19:12.500 --> 00:19:14.730
What's that space battleship doing?

00:19:15.060 --> 00:19:19.160
You'd step over your own spaceships to get to Earth?!

00:19:25.960 --> 00:19:28.130
Fire! We can't let them escape!

00:19:34.230 --> 00:19:35.860
Don't go out! Withdraw!

00:19:35.900 --> 00:19:39.330
Look at all those guns! We can't even face them one on one?!

00:19:41.600 --> 00:19:43.360
Üso, farewell!

00:19:43.760 --> 00:19:46.030
Don't go! You can't go!

00:19:49.660 --> 00:19:50.930
You won't escape!

00:19:50.960 --> 00:19:51.960
Except...

00:19:52.400 --> 00:19:56.000
I think she's taking her into that ship.

00:19:56.100 --> 00:19:58.930
You can't just recklessly use your rifle, right?

00:19:59.500 --> 00:20:01.700
You're saying to not attack?

00:20:02.230 --> 00:20:06.000
Right! Our only protection is one toy boat called the White Ark!

00:20:06.030 --> 00:20:07.460
It's out of the question!

00:20:07.500 --> 00:20:09.860
And the Federation Forces won't move, either.

00:20:10.360 --> 00:20:12.930
Marbet's gone to the White Ark?

00:20:13.100 --> 00:20:17.060
She probably wants to be where Oliver's scent hasn't faded.

00:20:18.130 --> 00:20:23.060
Since we're mounting a pursuit battle, I want this ship resupplied!

00:20:23.160 --> 00:20:26.630
I know! It's because we're going to Earth!

00:20:26.930 --> 00:20:29.330
She isn't crying. She's angry.

00:20:29.760 --> 00:20:33.130
It's to keep her from thinking about Mr. Oliver.

00:20:36.000 --> 00:20:37.560
I'll get on it, fast.

00:20:37.600 --> 00:20:38.630
Please.

00:20:44.630 --> 00:20:45.500
What's wrong?

00:20:45.530 --> 00:20:46.930
M-Miss Marbet...

00:20:47.100 --> 00:20:49.100
