00:20:53.960 --> 00:20:56.430
You can't just dwell on it!

00:20:56.460 --> 00:20:59.830
No, after we talked so big before...

00:21:00.630 --> 00:21:04.400
It's because we're amateurs... We're really sorry we let you down!

00:21:04.430 --> 00:21:05.660
You guys...

00:21:09.030 --> 00:21:10.160
I see.

00:21:16.200 --> 00:21:20.330
He left you for me to take care of.

00:21:21.060 --> 00:21:22.460
He...

00:21:31.460 --> 00:21:32.800
That's right.

00:21:33.130 --> 00:21:38.730
The Victory Mk. II's Hanger and Boots are now Mr. Oliver's mementos!

00:21:41.230 --> 00:21:43.000
On the other side of the stars, hoshi no mukou ni

00:21:43.000 --> 00:21:45.530
Grieve as much as you want.

00:21:45.560 --> 00:21:48.260
You can command Shrike Team next!

00:21:48.330 --> 00:21:50.000
It's only natural!

00:21:50.030 --> 00:21:52.700
there lies the future mirai ga aru to

00:21:53.660 --> 00:21:55.100
Oliver...

00:23:31.560 --> 00:23:34.400
To strike the Adrastea as it's undergoing repairs,

00:23:34.430 --> 00:23:38.600
Odelo and Tomáš head out for their first battle.

00:23:39.430 --> 00:23:43.660
A dragon-like mobile armor stands before the two of them.

00:23:43.730 --> 00:23:47.230
What's more, they're also forced to fight BESPA soldiers...

00:23:47.260 --> 00:23:49.660
...who are climbing all over their machines!

